  message: "Third instance of the same mechanism filed 2026-11-01 as WI-favig: Apex and LaTeX both claim *.cls (repro: files_analyzed=2 for each on a 2-file fixture). A registry-time check that every glob claimed by more than one analyzer has a classifier would cover .v, .pp and .cls together."  # bea7
